                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@Freddie.Jheng@quantatw.com But these events are going to persist across ac cycles, isn't it? So, if you won't resolve them when the system comes back up they will continue to show as Unresolved ?  Have you verified that?"
